---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
---

<DocLayout title="Components" description="Farn component patterns — layout, navigation, actions, forms, data display, and status feedback">
  <h1>Components</h1>
  <p>
    Farn is a design token system with an optional component layer. Tokens give you the
    vocabulary; component classes give you a starting point — override the tokens to retheme
    without touching the classes.
  </p>
  <p>All component classes consume semantic tokens so they adapt to dark/light mode and surface context automatically.</p>

  <div class="card-grid">

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/components/layout">
      <div class="card-media card-preview co-preview-layout" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="card card-outlined co-mini-card">
          <div class="co-mini-card-header"></div>
          <div class="co-mini-card-body"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Layout</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Cards, section transitions, separators, and quotes — structural components for organising content.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/components/navigation">
      <div class="card-media card-preview co-preview-nav" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="co-nav-demo">
          <div class="co-mini-breadcrumb">
            <span>Home</span><span class="co-sep">›</span><span>Components</span><span class="co-sep">›</span><span class="co-current">Navigation</span>
          </div>
          <div class="co-mini-tab-list">
            <span class="co-mini-tab co-mini-tab-active">Breadcrumbs</span>
            <span class="co-mini-tab">Tabs</span>
            <span class="co-mini-tab">Pagination</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Navigation</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Breadcrumbs, accordions, tabs, and pagination — components for orientation and movement.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/components/actions">
      <div class="card-media card-preview co-preview-actions" aria-hidden="true">
        <button class="btn btn-p" tabindex="-1">Primary</button>
        <button class="btn btn-s" tabindex="-1">Secondary</button>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Actions</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Buttons and links — four variants cover the full intent spectrum from confirmation to destructive.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/components/forms">
      <div class="card-media card-preview co-preview-forms" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="co-form-demo" aria-hidden="true">
          <label class="co-demo-label">Email</label>
          <input type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" tabindex="-1">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Forms</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Input, textarea, and select styles consuming <code>--input-*</code> tokens — no extra classes on native elements.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/components/data">
      <div class="card-media card-preview co-preview-data" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="badge badge-general">General</span>
        <span class="badge badge-published">Published</span>
        <span class="badge badge-draft">Draft</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Data</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Badges, tables, code blocks — seven badge variants and full table density tiers.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/components/status">
      <div class="card-media card-preview co-preview-status" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Status</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Spinners, skeleton loaders, and tooltips — visual language for async state and feedback.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

  </div>

  <h2>Using component classes</h2>
  <p>All component classes ship in <code>dist/farn-components.css</code>. Load it alongside <code>farn.css</code> or <code>farn-tokens.css</code>.</p>
  <pre><code>&lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/farn-theme/dist/farn.css"&gt;
&lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/farn-theme/dist/farn-components.css"&gt;</code></pre>

  <h3>Surfaces and theme context</h3>
  <p>All components inherit the correct tokens automatically when placed inside a <code>data-surface</code> or <code>data-theme</code> context.</p>
  <pre><code>&lt;!-- depth levels (relative to page theme) --&gt;
&lt;section data-surface="base"&gt; … &lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-surface="layer"&gt; … &lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-surface="overlay"&gt; … &lt;/section&gt;

&lt;!-- forced theme (sets background + all tokens) --&gt;
&lt;section data-theme="dark"&gt; … &lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section data-theme="dark" data-surface="layer"&gt; … &lt;/section&gt;</code></pre>
</DocLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Layout preview ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .co-mini-card {
    width: 140px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .co-mini-card-header {
    height: 36px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--fo3-deepwater) 0%, var(--fo1-fern) 100%);
  }
  .co-mini-card-body {
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .co-mini-card-body::before,
  .co-mini-card-body::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-border);
  }
  .co-mini-card-body::after { width: 70%; }

  /* ── Navigation preview ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .co-preview-nav { align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .co-nav-demo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 var(--space-xs);
  }
  .co-mini-breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }
  .co-sep { color: var(--color-text-tertiary); }
  .co-current { color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 500; }
  .co-mini-tab-list {
    display: flex;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .co-mini-tab {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    position: relative;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .co-mini-tab-active {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .co-mini-tab-active::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  /* ── Actions preview ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .co-preview-actions { gap: var(--space-sm); }

  /* ── Forms preview ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .co-form-demo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    width: 200px;
  }
  .co-demo-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* ── Data preview ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .co-preview-data { gap: var(--space-xs); flex-wrap: wrap; }

</style>
